WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.733 --> 00:00:09.633
Wait, please!

2
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.866
- Ah!
- Bonnie?

3
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:22.599
Hm? Coming!

4
00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:25.599
You're going to get lost if you keep wandering off.

5
00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:27.366
I'm fine, heh!

6
00:00:27.433 --> 00:00:30.666
Huh? Ah!

7
00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:33.400
Wow, I've never seen that Pokémon before.

8
00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:36.000
- That's a Furfrou.
- Huh? Furfrou?

9
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.800
Furfrou, the Poodle Pokémon.

10
00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:42.166
Furfrou were assigned the task of protecting kings

11
00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:44.466
who ruled the Kalos region in ancient times.

12
00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:47.466
It looks different from the one in the Pokédex.

13
00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:49.333
It probably went to the groomer!

14
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.800
There's a really famous Pokémon groomer in this town!

15
00:00:52.866 --> 00:00:55.533
- Look at this!
- Pokémon groomer?

16
00:00:55.599 --> 00:00:57.900
They're like hairdressers for Pokémon.

17
00:00:57.966 --> 00:01:01.099
In the world of Pokémon groomers, he's a superstar!

18
00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:05.600
- Wish I could meet him. Oh!
- Yeah, I wish I could meet him, too!

19
00:01:07.899 --> 00:01:11.566
- Huh? Ah.
- Bonnie!

20
00:01:11.633 --> 00:01:13.266
Hey! Are you okay?

21
00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:15.366
Pikachu!

22
00:01:17.733 --> 00:01:21.233
Oh. I'm so sorry! That Furfrou's with me!

23
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.166
Furfrou!

24
00:01:23.233 --> 00:01:25.433
Oh, no! You scraped your knees!

25
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.933
Don't worry about me! I'm just fine!

26
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.899
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

27
00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:34.466
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

28
00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:37.300
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

29
00:01:37.366 --> 00:01:40.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

30
00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.233
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

31
00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:46.566
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

32
00:01:46.633 --> 00:01:49.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

33
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

34
00:01:52.433 --> 00:01:54.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

35
00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:57.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon ♪

36
00:02:07.066 --> 00:02:08.866
That should do it.

37
00:02:09.866 --> 00:02:13.333
- Dedenne, how are you doing?
- Na-na!

38
00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:17.733
As the Kalos League continues to inspire Ash every step of the way,

39
00:02:17.799 --> 00:02:21.133
our heroes are now en route to Ash's second Gym battle challenge

40
00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.333
at the Cyllage City Gym.

41
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.833
I'm so sorry. Really.

42
00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:29.200
- Don't worry! I'm fine!
- Bonnie means it.

43
00:02:29.266 --> 00:02:32.266
Now, this is like the Furfrou in the Pokédex.

44
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:36.200
Furfrou still hasn't been groomed yet. I'm Jessica.

45
00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:38.600
My name's Ash. This is Pikachu.

46
00:02:38.666 --> 00:02:41.200
- Pika! Pikachu!
- I'm Serena.

47
00:02:41.266 --> 00:02:44.000
My name's Bonnie. This is my big brother.

48
00:02:44.066 --> 00:02:47.200
- I'm Clemont.
- Ah! Jessica's a keeper!

49
00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:50.766
I mean, please take care of my brother?

50
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:52.166
Huh?

51
00:02:52.233 --> 00:02:55.033
Bonnie, stop! I told you not to do that again.

52
00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.966
So embarrassing.

53
00:02:57.033 --> 00:02:59.766
I hope you'll think about it, please Jessica?

54
00:02:59.833 --> 00:03:02.900
- Uh, Oh, dear!
- Think about what?

55
00:03:02.966 --> 00:03:05.266
I can't look after my brother forever.

56
00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:09.166
So it's my job to look for a dependable wife for him!

57
00:03:13.533 --> 00:03:16.466
You see, I'm studying to be a Pokémon groomer.

58
00:03:16.533 --> 00:03:19.399
Wow! Are you going to groom your Furfrou?

59
00:03:19.466 --> 00:03:24.333
I really want to, but every time I try to do anything with its fur, it runs off.

60
00:03:24.399 --> 00:03:27.966
I only tried to brush it a bit earlier and that's when it ran away.

61
00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:29.466
I get it now.

62
00:03:29.533 --> 00:03:32.966
Furfrou are very intelligent and know exactly what they want.

63
00:03:33.033 --> 00:03:36.366
They won't listen to a Trainer until they see that person as their partner.

64
00:03:36.433 --> 00:03:40.366
So does that mean Furfrou doesn't see you as its real Trainer yet?

65
00:03:40.433 --> 00:03:42.600
Hey! Bonnie!

66
00:03:42.666 --> 00:03:46.333
- I'm sorry.
- It's okay, Bonnie.

67
00:03:46.399 --> 00:03:47.866
You've got it exactly right.

68
00:03:47.933 --> 00:03:51.766
Now I want to see how Pokémon groomers style Furfrou even more!

69
00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:53.966
I do, too! I do, too!

70
00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:58.566
Why not see where I work, to make up for those scraped knees?

71
00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.633
This is the grooming salon where I'm being trained.

72
00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.866
We've seen this before, remember?

73
00:04:08.866 --> 00:04:12.000
Hey, look. That's the guy we saw in Serena's travel guide!

74
00:04:12.066 --> 00:04:15.566
Wow! Talk about an unbelievable coincidence.

75
00:04:15.633 --> 00:04:17.633
It's him!

76
00:04:18.899 --> 00:04:20.899
Huh?

77
00:04:23.599 --> 00:04:26.966
Jessica! Are you finished giving your Furfrou a walk?

78
00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.966
Sherman, I'd like you to introduce you to Clemont and Ash

79
00:04:30.033 --> 00:04:31.766
and Bonnie and Serena.

80
00:04:31.833 --> 00:04:34.133
I saw an article about you in the guidebook!

81
00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.966
You're a grooming superstar! It's such an honor to meet you!

82
00:04:38.033 --> 00:04:41.766
I do think superstar is a bit of an exaggeration.

83
00:04:41.833 --> 00:04:45.333
Huh? Look at all those scissors!

84
00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.400
They're all very interested in learning about Pokémon groomers.

85
00:04:48.466 --> 00:04:50.766
Well, in that case, why don't you fill them in?

86
00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:52.266
- Ah.
- Sure!

87
00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:54.866
Ah.

88
00:04:54.933 --> 00:04:58.266
-Pika!

89
00:04:58.333 --> 00:04:59.933
Look at all the berries.

90
00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:04.166
You noticed! Well, Bonnie, there's a lot more to grooming Pokémon

91
00:05:04.233 --> 00:05:06.000
than simply grooming their fur.

92
00:05:06.066 --> 00:05:08.766
We give each Pokémon a thorough health exam.

93
00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:12.933
You can tell if a Pokémon is eating well simply by feeling its fur.

94
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.366
So the amount of fur that gets cut depends on how healthy it is.

95
00:05:16.433 --> 00:05:18.733
You have to know all about that, too?

96
00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.099
Learning about nutrition is a must!

97
00:05:21.166 --> 00:05:23.866
For example, we recommend a Rawst or Lum Berry

98
00:05:23.933 --> 00:05:25.933
for when a Pokémon's not feeling well.

99
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.466
And see? A Tamato Berry can helps stimulate their appetite.

100
00:05:29.533 --> 00:05:31.266
-Ah!

101
00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:34.900
- I feel like my head's going to explode.
- Pika! Pi!

102
00:05:34.966 --> 00:05:38.233
We also have ten different types of shampoo and conditioner

103
00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:41.666
to choose from, depending on the fur quality of the client.

104
00:05:41.733 --> 00:05:43.233
That's incredible.

105
00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.400
Take a look at the scissors and combs we use.

106
00:05:45.466 --> 00:05:48.333
Each custom made for whatever style we're doing.

107
00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.066
- Ah! Dedenne, look at them all!
- Dedenne!

108
00:05:53.133 --> 00:05:56.599
That reminds me! I just finished up with two more clients.

109
00:05:56.666 --> 00:05:58.566
Would you all like to have a little peek?

110
00:05:58.633 --> 00:06:01.833
- Sure!
- Jessica, please bring the Furfrou in.

111
00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.866
Right!

112
00:06:11.766 --> 00:06:13.233
Furfrou!

113
00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.700
Wow, they've got so much style!

114
00:06:18.933 --> 00:06:21.233
Furfrou, the Poodle Pokémon.

115
00:06:21.299 --> 00:06:23.766
So they're both Furfrou as well?

116
00:06:23.833 --> 00:06:26.533
They don't look like the same kind of Pokémon at all.

117
00:06:26.599 --> 00:06:30.266
- You can say that again.
- They're both just so elegant!

118
00:06:30.333 --> 00:06:34.733
I want to style my Furfrou like that. I just hope it'll let me someday.

119
00:06:34.799 --> 00:06:37.599
Of course you'll be able to style Furfrou!

120
00:06:37.666 --> 00:06:39.966
Oh, this is all so dreamy.

121
00:06:40.033 --> 00:06:43.166
She's right, Jessica. It's important to be confident!

122
00:06:43.233 --> 00:06:46.066
It is true her Furfrou is quite stubborn, though.

123
00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:48.000
It won't let her groom it at all.

124
00:06:48.066 --> 00:06:49.566
Yeah, that's what she told us.

125
00:06:49.633 --> 00:06:54.299
It is my wish that Jessica's and Furfrou's hearts will become one someday.

126
00:06:54.366 --> 00:06:56.566
But still, there's no need to rush things.

127
00:06:56.633 --> 00:06:59.066
I guess.

128
00:06:59.133 --> 00:07:02.700
Hm. Wait. Is this your first time in the city?

129
00:07:02.766 --> 00:07:04.766
- Yeah!
- I have an idea.

130
00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:07.666
Why don't you show them around on your lunch break, Jessica?

131
00:07:07.733 --> 00:07:09.233
Great!

132
00:07:12.299 --> 00:07:15.599
There's a spot with a beautiful view just up the street a little bit.

133
00:07:15.666 --> 00:07:18.433
Awesome! I can't wait to see it!

134
00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.500
Why hello there, Pikachu.

135
00:07:21.566 --> 00:07:24.866
How would you like to be a furshionista?

136
00:07:24.933 --> 00:07:26.933
- Sparkly.
- Spangly.

137
00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.700
- Twinkly.
- Glittery.

138
00:07:28.766 --> 00:07:30.666
Snip, snip.

139
00:07:32.833 --> 00:07:34.299
Huh?

140
00:07:34.366 --> 00:07:38.133
This is none other than superstar hair stylist extraordinaire Jessally!

141
00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.900
- Hold on. Jessally?
- Yes!

142
00:07:40.966 --> 00:07:45.066
Winner of the crown for best makeup and the gold medal for styling!

143
00:07:45.133 --> 00:07:47.599
And the golden scissors award for hair design!

144
00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:50.133
And other accolades too numerous to mention!

145
00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.633
Success for me is a piece of designer cake!

146
00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.833
-Pika!

147
00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:56.433
Why haven't I heard of any of those?

148
00:07:56.500 --> 00:08:01.400
A top hairstylist, Jessally has now become a Pokémon groomer!

149
00:08:01.466 --> 00:08:04.833
That's right. Why not take a look at my creations?

150
00:08:06.466 --> 00:08:08.400
Huh?

151
00:08:08.466 --> 00:08:11.599
Watch Jessally transform the most unsightly Pokémon

152
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:14.666
and enjoy the Wobbuffet Transformathon !

153
00:08:18.633 --> 00:08:22.599
Wo! Wo! Wo! Wo! Wo!

154
00:08:22.666 --> 00:08:25.133
Wobbuffet!

155
00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.500
Wo! Wo! Wo!

156
00:08:27.566 --> 00:08:29.533
Presenting the Curly Top!

157
00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.866
And feast your eyes on this! The Fear-ican!

158
00:08:33.933 --> 00:08:35.333
Wo! Wobbuffet!

159
00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.466
The chic fringe look!

160
00:08:37.533 --> 00:08:39.566
Wobbuffet!

161
00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:42.533
They're all kind of boring.

162
00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.433
- The Curly Top was cute!
- Huh?

163
00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:49.366
And that's only the tip of the styling iceberg. Get ready for the main act!

164
00:08:49.433 --> 00:08:51.733
The Wob-bouffant!

165
00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.366
Wobbuffet!

166
00:08:53.433 --> 00:08:56.566
- The haunting, silky smile look!
- Wobbuffet!

167
00:08:56.633 --> 00:08:59.066
- The flowing perm!
- Wobbuffet!

168
00:08:59.133 --> 00:09:02.633
- And rich girl ringlet curls!
- Wo! Wobbu! Wobbu!

169
00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:08.266
- We have last word in styling!
- That wasn't so bad.

170
00:09:08.333 --> 00:09:11.133
When it comes to styling sass, I'm top of the class!

171
00:09:11.199 --> 00:09:16.133
You there, Pikachu. Care to experience a small sample of my grooming magic?

172
00:09:16.199 --> 00:09:18.133
Pika! Pika!

173
00:09:18.199 --> 00:09:20.966
I think Pikachu looks fine just like this.

174
00:09:21.033 --> 00:09:26.400
Aw! Serena, how about Fennekin? I know it's already a cutie pie

175
00:09:26.466 --> 00:09:29.600
but maybe some styling will make it an even cutier pie!

176
00:09:29.666 --> 00:09:32.199
That sounds like a good idea! Come out, Fennekin.

177
00:09:35.633 --> 00:09:38.100
How would you like to do some styling on my Fennekin?

178
00:09:38.166 --> 00:09:40.100
Ugh, we want Pikachu.

179
00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:43.500
Uh, this is the chance to catch a Kalos region Pokémon!

180
00:09:43.566 --> 00:09:47.033
I accept. My grooming skills are second to none!

181
00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.600
- I'll happily style your Fennekin!
- Okay. Thanks.

182
00:09:53.066 --> 00:09:56.900
Jessally performs her magic in private, so please come back in an hour.

183
00:09:56.966 --> 00:09:59.433
But I wanted to watch her perform her magic!

184
00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:03.600
Mm-mm-mm. Jessally's grooming magic is an industry secret

185
00:10:03.666 --> 00:10:05.366
so it stays hush-hush!

186
00:10:05.433 --> 00:10:06.900
But it will only take an hour,

187
00:10:06.966 --> 00:10:11.100
well worth the time to create Fennekin fashion!

188
00:10:11.166 --> 00:10:13.800
Okay. See you in an hour.

189
00:10:23.166 --> 00:10:27.199
I really wanted to watch how Jessally styles Fennekin.

190
00:10:27.266 --> 00:10:31.533
- I'm sure you did.
- Ah. It's Officer Jenny!

191
00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.800
Thank you for all of your help during the Rhyhorn race!

192
00:10:34.866 --> 00:10:37.166
You must be talking about my second cousin.

193
00:10:37.233 --> 00:10:40.166
Here's a picture of me when I was a cadet attending

194
00:10:40.233 --> 00:10:43.166
the Officer Jenny Training Academy.

195
00:10:43.233 --> 00:10:46.666
- Wow. There certainly are a lot of you.
- Oh! I knew it.

196
00:10:46.733 --> 00:10:49.866
Now, if you don't mind, there's something I'd like to ask you.

197
00:10:49.933 --> 00:10:52.566
- What's that?
- Have you seen any con artists?

198
00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:54.633
- Con artists?
- That's right!

199
00:10:54.699 --> 00:10:57.533
There is a woman who claims to be a famous Pokémon groomer,

200
00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:00.400
but once she gets a Pokémon, she and her gang vanish!

201
00:11:00.466 --> 00:11:02.066
- Ah!
- Tell us more!

202
00:11:02.133 --> 00:11:05.466
It's a group of four who likes to dress really flamboyantly.

203
00:11:05.533 --> 00:11:07.266
Two wear flashy glasses.

204
00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:09.633
- It's them!
- Pika! Pika!

205
00:11:09.699 --> 00:11:11.000
Fennekin's in trouble!

206
00:11:12.633 --> 00:11:15.166
-I guess we're too late.

207
00:11:15.233 --> 00:11:17.433
Are you sure this is where you met them?

208
00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.133
Yeah.

209
00:11:23.666 --> 00:11:26.966
Hey, Furfrou, are you picking up on their scent?

210
00:11:27.033 --> 00:11:28.500
Furfrou! Frou!

211
00:11:28.566 --> 00:11:31.100
- Furfrou, wait for me!
- Huh?

212
00:11:31.166 --> 00:11:33.933
Quick, we've got to follow those two!

213
00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.466
Who's that Pokémon?

214
00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.066
It's Furfrou!

215
00:11:52.066 --> 00:11:56.466
It's in the bag! Fennekin's our premier Kalos collection Pokémon!

216
00:11:56.533 --> 00:11:58.166
One of many, I'm sure!

217
00:11:58.233 --> 00:12:00.833
- It's time for plan number two!
- Of course!

218
00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.033
By that you mean catch Pikachu!

219
00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.900
Huh?

220
00:12:05.966 --> 00:12:08.900
- Argh! What's that called?
- A Furfrou!

221
00:12:08.966 --> 00:12:10.766
- Oh, let's catch that!
- Furfrou!

222
00:12:10.833 --> 00:12:13.000
Furfrou! Frou!

223
00:12:13.066 --> 00:12:16.166
- Don't let them get away!
- Hey! Give Fennekin back!

224
00:12:16.233 --> 00:12:17.733
Hmm.

225
00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.566
Prepare for trouble, pushy twerps!

226
00:12:21.633 --> 00:12:23.833
And make it double, we're primo perps!

227
00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.333
To protect the world from devastation!

228
00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.966
To unite all people within our nation!

229
00:12:29.033 --> 00:12:32.066
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

230
00:12:32.133 --> 00:12:35.133
To extend our reach to the stars above!

231
00:12:35.199 --> 00:12:38.199
- Jessie!
- And James!

232
00:12:38.266 --> 00:12:41.000
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

233
00:12:41.066 --> 00:12:43.866
Surrender now or prepare for one stylish fight!

234
00:12:43.933 --> 00:12:47.066
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

235
00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.866
- Team Rocket!
- Return the Pokémon you stole!

236
00:12:50.933 --> 00:12:53.933
If you want 'em, you'll have to come and get 'em!

237
00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.766
Manectric, let's go!

238
00:12:58.166 --> 00:12:59.900
Manectric?

239
00:13:01.133 --> 00:13:03.166
Manectric, the Discharge Pokémon.

240
00:13:03.233 --> 00:13:05.533
Manectric collects electricity from the air,

241
00:13:05.599 --> 00:13:07.633
creating a thundercloud above its head.

242
00:13:07.699 --> 00:13:10.166
Its mane gives off a strong electric current.

243
00:13:10.233 --> 00:13:14.566
- Amazing.
- Inkay! Gangway!

244
00:13:15.566 --> 00:13:17.233
-Use Thunderbolt!

245
00:13:19.733 --> 00:13:21.333
Dodge it!

246
00:13:23.066 --> 00:13:24.599
Now, Tackle!

247
00:13:27.233 --> 00:13:28.900
Manectric, Quick Attack!

248
00:13:31.266 --> 00:13:33.966
Ah! Use Psybeam!

249
00:13:38.699 --> 00:13:40.466
- Oh! Manectric!
- Officer Jenny!

250
00:13:40.533 --> 00:13:43.666
Psybeam's effect is causing it to be confused!

251
00:13:43.733 --> 00:13:46.033
Return!

252
00:13:46.099 --> 00:13:50.566
Leave them to me! Let's do this, Pikachu! Quick Attack!

253
00:13:50.633 --> 00:13:56.033
Pik! Pik! Pik! Pik! Pik! Pik! Pik! Pika!

254
00:13:56.099 --> 00:13:59.033
Pikachu! Pika! Pika!

255
00:13:59.099 --> 00:14:01.533
No! Pikachu, are you okay?

256
00:14:01.599 --> 00:14:05.800
There's got to be something we can do to help. Oh!

257
00:14:07.366 --> 00:14:09.800
Oh! Clemont, help them!

258
00:14:09.866 --> 00:14:12.866
- Hm.
- It's okay, Clemont!

259
00:14:12.933 --> 00:14:15.166
- We can still battle, right Pikachu?
- Pika!

260
00:14:15.233 --> 00:14:17.666
Finish this with Tackle!

261
00:14:20.099 --> 00:14:24.400
- Pikachu! Jump and dodge it!
- Pika!

262
00:14:24.466 --> 00:14:28.133
- Psybeam, let's go!
- Pikachu, on the ground and roll!

263
00:14:32.099 --> 00:14:33.966
Turn around and use Thunderbolt!

264
00:14:34.033 --> 00:14:37.333
- Pikachu!
- Spectacular.

265
00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.099
Now, your turn Wobbuffet!

266
00:14:40.166 --> 00:14:43.300
Wobbuffet!

267
00:14:43.366 --> 00:14:46.366
Pikachu, jump and dodge!

268
00:14:46.433 --> 00:14:50.433
- Aim behind you and use Iron Tail!
- Pika!

269
00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.266
- Dodge it!
- Wobbuffet!

270
00:14:53.333 --> 00:14:55.533
Pikachu! Stay put and use Thunderbolt!

271
00:14:55.599 --> 00:15:00.466
Pika! Pikachu!

272
00:15:00.533 --> 00:15:05.266
- Wobbuffet, you know what to do!
- Wobbuffet!

273
00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:10.733
- Pikachu, jump up!
- Pika!

274
00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:14.833
-Ash and Pikachu are awesome.

275
00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:15.933
Pik!

276
00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:20.166
I can't believe that Ash is acting as Pikachu's eyes while the battle goes on.

277
00:15:20.233 --> 00:15:23.433
I used to be surprised at this kind of stuff, too,

278
00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.199
but now I know this is something only they can pull off!

279
00:15:26.266 --> 00:15:28.166
Because they trust each other!

280
00:15:28.233 --> 00:15:29.900
Trust each other?

281
00:15:29.966 --> 00:15:32.633
Won't you please let me at least brush you?

282
00:15:32.699 --> 00:15:36.066
See? I promise I won't cut your fur.

283
00:15:37.066 --> 00:15:39.066
Please? May I?

284
00:15:39.133 --> 00:15:43.233
I know you'll love it. I...

285
00:15:44.599 --> 00:15:48.133
- Use Tackle!
- Jump to the right and dodge it!

286
00:15:53.566 --> 00:15:57.500
In the meantime, I think I'll catch us another Pokémon!

287
00:15:57.566 --> 00:15:58.699
Fur! Furfrou!

288
00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:03.433
No, Furfrou!

289
00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:07.599
Furfrou. Fru!

290
00:16:07.666 --> 00:16:11.599
- Well, we've had quite a haul today!
- Wobbuffet!

291
00:16:11.666 --> 00:16:15.666
Fro!

292
00:16:15.733 --> 00:16:17.233
Oh!

293
00:16:20.066 --> 00:16:21.733
My poor Furfrou.

294
00:16:24.533 --> 00:16:25.966
Furfrou. Furfrou.

295
00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:30.333
Furfrou!

296
00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.000
Furfrou.

297
00:16:33.066 --> 00:16:36.800
My Furfrou!

298
00:16:36.866 --> 00:16:40.900
Give me back my Furfrou right now!

299
00:16:46.599 --> 00:16:48.900
Jessica, you'll hurt yourself!

300
00:16:48.966 --> 00:16:51.066
- No, Furfrou!
- Furfrou!

301
00:16:51.133 --> 00:16:53.433
Oh. Clemont!

302
00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.033
Bunnelby, come out and help us!

303
00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:00.933
All right, Bunnelby, use Mud Shot and destroy that cage!

304
00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.866
Bunnelby!

305
00:17:03.933 --> 00:17:05.966
- Go, Wobbuffet!
- Wobbu!

306
00:17:06.033 --> 00:17:09.033
- Bunnelby, use Dig!
- Bunnelbrrrr!

307
00:17:13.099 --> 00:17:14.566
Wob! Wob! Wob!

308
00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:19.500
Pikachu, use Thunderbolt, straight ahead!

309
00:17:19.566 --> 00:17:22.933
Pikachu!

310
00:17:24.366 --> 00:17:28.033
Why you? Take this! Argh!

311
00:17:32.833 --> 00:17:34.566
Oh.

312
00:17:36.133 --> 00:17:39.566
You're safe!

313
00:17:39.633 --> 00:17:43.500
Let me wipe that icky ink off of you. You're all clean!

314
00:17:43.566 --> 00:17:44.866
Pika! Pika"

315
00:17:51.066 --> 00:17:54.433
Hey. Do you want to have a battle with them?

316
00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:57.800
I've got it! Use Charge Beam!

317
00:17:57.866 --> 00:17:59.633
Furfrou!

318
00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.133
We're blasting off again!

319
00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:08.033
- Wobbuffet!
- Inkay!

320
00:18:12.333 --> 00:18:15.366
Oh! Thank goodness you're all right!

321
00:18:17.399 --> 00:18:20.533
I'll return all of these stolen Poké Balls to their Trainers.

322
00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:23.266
- Thank you, Ash, and everyone!
- No prob!

323
00:18:23.333 --> 00:18:27.433
Hey, Clemont? Didn't we just see Furfrou listen to Jessica?

324
00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.500
- Yeah, you're right!
- Pika!

325
00:18:29.566 --> 00:18:33.966
Maybe that means Furfrou's starting to see you as its partner now!

326
00:18:34.033 --> 00:18:36.200
- Hm!
- I'm sure of it!

327
00:18:36.266 --> 00:18:38.066
Mm-hm!

328
00:18:39.066 --> 00:18:43.066
Oh, Furfrou. Will you finally let me style you now?

329
00:18:43.133 --> 00:18:45.966
- Frou!
- Ah! Furfrou!

330
00:18:50.233 --> 00:18:52.933
- First, let's get you all brushed.
- Furfrou!

331
00:19:00.066 --> 00:19:05.000
Look at that big smile. Such confidence! What a welcome sight.

332
00:19:05.066 --> 00:19:09.466
Seeing Jessica and Furfrou look so happy is so nice.

333
00:19:10.566 --> 00:19:13.200
It looks like you're at the peak of health!

334
00:19:43.633 --> 00:19:44.966
So, what do you think?

335
00:19:45.033 --> 00:19:47.933
- Beautiful!
- And such style!

336
00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.666
- True perfection!
- Thank you so much!

337
00:19:50.733 --> 00:19:53.600
- Furfrou!
- Thanks to you too.

338
00:19:53.666 --> 00:19:55.700
I owe so much to every one of you!

339
00:19:55.766 --> 00:19:58.733
Mm. It's because you connected with Furfrou's heart!

340
00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:02.566
I'm going to make the bond between Furfrou and me grow deeper and deeper

341
00:20:02.633 --> 00:20:04.733
and groom as much as I possibly can.

342
00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.233
Someday, I'll be a famous groomer!

343
00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:10.966
And when you do, will you style my Fennekin?

344
00:20:11.033 --> 00:20:12.466
Of course!

345
00:20:13.466 --> 00:20:14.666
Take care!

346
00:20:14.733 --> 00:20:17.100
Next time you travel this way, please stop by!

347
00:20:17.166 --> 00:20:20.833
- Okay. Good bye!
- Pika! Pika!

348
00:20:25.933 --> 00:20:29.600
It must be nice to have something you can be really passionate about.

349
00:20:29.666 --> 00:20:31.300
Huh? What'd you say?

350
00:20:31.366 --> 00:20:36.066
Oh, nothing. I can't wait to get to Lumiose City!

351
00:20:36.133 --> 00:20:37.933
Huh?

352
00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.899
Jessica has forged a real bond with Furfrou

353
00:20:40.966 --> 00:20:43.133
and grown as a Pokémon groomer.

354
00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:47.833
Now, our heroes hit the road again, as the journey continues!
